sequenceDiagram
    participant Sat as Satellite
    participant GW as AAP Gateway (:443)
    participant EDA as EDA Event Stream
    participant Act as EDA Activation (rulebook)
    participant Ctrl as AAP Controller
    participant Script as vulnerability_remediation.py
    participant Host as Affected hosts

    Note over Sat: Remote execution job succeeds
    Sat->>GW: HTTPS POST (Basic Auth)
    GW->>EDA: routes to external_event_stream/uuid/post/
    EDA->>EDA: validates username/password
    EDA->>Act: delivers event to running rulebook
    Act->>Act: rule fires, logs event

    Act->>Ctrl: run_job_template(Vulnerability Package Finder and Remediator, extra_vars: host_name)
    Ctrl->>Script: run unscoped scan
    Script->>Sat: query Red Hat Lightspeed Vulnerability API for CVEs
    Sat-->>Script: CVEs and which hosts they affect
    Script->>Sat: query Katello errata API for fixes
    Sat-->>Script: errata and the packages that fix them
    Script-->>Ctrl: hosts with at least one installable remediation

    loop For each affected host
        Ctrl->>Script: run per-host scan (--host)
        Script->>Sat: re-query Katello for that host's installed packages
        Sat-->>Script: installed package versions
        Script-->>Ctrl: exact packages that host needs
        Ctrl->>Host: ansible.builtin.dnf install
    end
